OL,3,GNEWSAWildlife visitor centres close as
OL,4,Apart of 'refocus'
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo wildlife visitor centres run by a
OL,7,Fcharity are to close, with one being
OL,8,Fturned into an education space and the
OL,9,Fother being upgraded.
OL,11,FThe Wildlife Trust for Bedfordshire,
OL,12,FCambridgeshire and Northamptonshire
OL,13,Fsaid the Nene Wetlands Visitor Centre
OL,14,Fat Rushden Lakes shopping centre will
OL,15,Fclose at the end of September and
OL,16,Freopen in December.
OL,18,FThe centre at Summer Leys nature
OL,19,Freserve, close to Wollaston,
OL,20,FNorthamptonshire, will shut from the
OL,21,Fbeginning of November and reopen next
OL,22,Fyear as an education space.
OL,23,APub: 13-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
